// Whole pictures the shell shows at their authored size, never tiles.
//
// A name here is an engine asset key the client asks for by hand, not a
// sprite the wire can name; the path is relative to the tgstation
// checkout's root (unlike sounds.ron, which is relative to `sound/`)
// because these come from wherever tg keeps them rather than from one
// media directory. Every source is a single-cell `.dmi` and is decoded,
// re-encoded as PNG and published by digest like everything else
// (docs/ASSETS.md §6.1).
[
    // tg's title screen, behind the main menu.
    ("menu_bg", "icons/runtime/default_title.dmi"),
]
